  "limits": [
    "The legacy hard codec remains the low-14-bit X comparator; it uses 30 s context, while the new encoder sees one 2 s patch. The final operating points require more bits.",
    "Study-defined waveforms are downstream of G0 preprocessing, including subject-local Hb calibration; not a raw prospective deployment.",
    "Current-patch autocorrelation and Hb endpoint readouts are related mathematically to the named pattern features. Future patch/held-out task do not demonstrate a biological cause.",
